            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MotionUI 1.3.20</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The Figma tab now says what each plugin is for. MotionUI is the Figma version, one click from the Community. MotionUI Agent is the local one: Figma does not list plugins that let an assistant work inside your file, so you install it yourself, and then Claude builds directly in Figma and the work carries on into After Effects.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
